{"html":"<figure class=\"technical-flow policy-architecture\" aria-labelledby=\"architecture-caption\">\n<header class=\"network-heading\"><strong>Vision-conditioned Diffusion Policy</strong></header>\n<p class=\"network-scroll-hint\">On narrow screens, scroll panels horizontally. The full text equivalent follows.</p>\n<div class=\"network-legend\"><span class=\"signal\">Signal / action flow</span><span class=\"conditioning\">Conditioning</span><span class=\"skip\">Skip connection</span><span>cat = concatenate · T = time positions · C = channels</span></div>\n<div class=\"network-panel-label\">A · Visual features and observation history</div>\n<div class=\"network-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Visual features and observation history — horizontally scrollable\"><svg class=\"network-svg\" data-network-panel=\"a\" viewBox=\"0 0 960 455\" width=\"960\" height=\"455\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"network-title-a\" aria-describedby=\"network-description-a\"><title id=\"network-title-a\">Visual features and observation history</title><desc id=\"network-description-a\">Three independent trainable ResNet34 encoders each produce 128 values after spatial softmax and projection. Concatenate these with 18 state values. Flatten three observations to 1,206 context values.</desc><defs><marker id=\"network-arrow-a\" viewBox=\"0 0 8 8\" refX=\"7\" refY=\"4\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0 0L8 4L0 8Z\"/></marker></defs><g data-node=\"rgb-0\"><rect x=\"20\" y=\"55\" width=\"150\" height=\"64\" rx=\"3\"/><text text-anchor=\"middle\"><tspan class=\"node-title\" x=\"95\" y=\"82\">Left RGB</tspan><tspan class=\"node-label\" x=\"95\" y=\"104\">3 × 288 × 288</tspan></text></g><g data-node=\"encoder-0\"><path d=\"M200 48H273.5L410 60V114L273.5 126H200Z\"/><text text-anchor=\"middle\"><tspan class=\"node-title\" x=\"305\" y=\"71\">ResNet34</tspan><tspan class=\"node-label\" x=\"305\" y=\"93\">feature map</tspan><tspan class=\"node-label\" x=\"305\" y=\"115\">512 × 9 × 9</tspan></text></g><g data-node=\"projection-0\"><rect x=\"445\" y=\"48\" width=\"200\" height=\"78\" rx=\"3\"/><text text-anchor=\"middle\"><tspan class=\"node-title\" x=\"545\" y=\"71\">Spatial softmax</tspan><tspan class=\"node-label\" x=\"545\" y=\"93\">64 coordinate pairs</tspan><tspan class=\"node-label\" x=\"545\" y=\"115\">Linear + ReLU → 128</tspan></text></g><path data-edge=\"image-0\" data-from=\"rgb-0\" data-to=\"encoder-0\" class=\"network-edge signal\" d=\"M170 87H200\" marker-end=\"url(#network-arrow-a)\"/><path data-edge=\"features-0\" data-from=\"encoder-0\" data-to=\"projection-0\" class=\"network-edge signal\" d=\"M410 87H445\" marker-end=\"url(#network-arrow-a)\"/><path class=\"network-edge signal\" d=\"M645 87H680\"/><g data-node=\"rgb-1\"><rect x=\"20\" y=\"155\" width=\"150\" height=\"64\" rx=\"3\"/><text text-anchor=\"middle\"><tspan class=\"node-title\" x=\"95\" y=\"182\">Center RGB</tspan><tspan class=\"node-label\" x=\"95\" y=\"204\">3 × 288 × 288</tspan></text></g><g data-node=\"encoder-1\"><path d=\"M200 148H273.5L410 160V214L273.5 226H200Z\"/><text text-anchor=\"middle\"><tspan class=\"node-title\" x=\"305\" y=\"171\">ResNet34</tspan><tspan class=\"node-label\" x=\"305\" y=\"193\">feature map</tspan><tspan class=\"node-label\" x=\"305\" y=\"215\">512 × 9 × 9</tspan></text></g><g data-node=\"projection-1\"><rect x=\"445\" y=\"148\" width=\"200\" height=\"78\" rx=\"3\"/><text text-anchor=\"middle\"><tspan class=\"node-title\" x=\"545\" y=\"171\">Spatial softmax</tspan><tspan class=\"node-label\" x=\"545\" y=\"193\">64 coordinate pairs</tspan><tspan class=\"node-label\" x=\"545\" y=\"215\">Linear + ReLU → 128</tspan></text></g><path data-edge=\"image-1\" data-from=\"rgb-1\" data-to=\"encoder-1\" class=\"network-edge signal\" d=\"M170 187H200\" marker-end=\"url(#network-arrow-a)\"/><path data-edge=\"features-1\" data-from=\"encoder-1\" data-to=\"projection-1\" class=\"network-edge signal\" d=\"M410 187H445\" marker-end=\"url(#network-arrow-a)\"/><path class=\"network-edge signal\" d=\"M645 187H680\"/><g data-node=\"rgb-2\"><rect x=\"20\" y=\"255\" width=\"150\" height=\"64\" rx=\"3\"/><text text-anchor=\"middle\"><tspan class=\"node-title\" x=\"95\" y=\"282\">Right RGB</tspan><tspan class=\"node-label\" x=\"95\" y=\"304\">3 × 288 × 288</tspan></text></g><g data-node=\"encoder-2\"><path d=\"M200 248H273.5L410 260V314L273.5 326H200Z\"/><text text-anchor=\"middle\"><tspan class=\"node-title\" x=\"305\" y=\"271\">ResNet34</tspan><tspan class=\"node-label\" x=\"305\" y=\"293\">feature map</tspan><tspan class=\"node-label\" x=\"305\" y=\"315\">512 × 9 × 9</tspan></text></g><g data-node=\"projection-2\"><rect x=\"445\" y=\"248\" width=\"200\" height=\"78\" rx=\"3\"/><text text-anchor=\"middle\"><tspan class=\"node-title\" x=\"545\" y=\"271\">Spatial softmax</tspan><tspan class=\"node-label\" x=\"545\" y=\"293\">64 coordinate pairs</tspan><tspan class=\"node-label\" x=\"545\" y=\"315\">Linear + ReLU → 128</tspan></text></g><path data-edge=\"image-2\" data-from=\"rgb-2\" data-to=\"encoder-2\" class=\"network-edge signal\" d=\"M170 287H200\" marker-end=\"url(#network-arrow-a)\"/><path data-edge=\"features-2\" data-from=\"encoder-2\" data-to=\"projection-2\" class=\"network-edge signal\" d=\"M410 287H445\" marker-end=\"url(#network-arrow-a)\"/><path class=\"network-edge signal\" d=\"M645 287H680\"/><g data-node=\"state\"><rect x=\"445\" y=\"355\" width=\"200\" height=\"78\" rx=\"3\"/><text text-anchor=\"middle\"><tspan class=\"node-title\" x=\"545\" y=\"378\">TCP + task state</tspan><tspan class=\"node-label\" x=\"545\" y=\"400\">18 values</tspan><tspan class=\"node-label\" x=\"545\" y=\"422\">position · rot6 · task</tspan></text></g><path class=\"network-edge signal\" d=\"M645 394H680V87\"/><g data-node=\"concat-observations\"><rect x=\"700\" y=\"167\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" rx=\"3\"/><text text-anchor=\"middle\"><tspan class=\"node-title\" x=\"720\" y=\"193\">cat</tspan></text></g><path data-edge=\"fusion\" data-from=\"projection-state\" data-to=\"concat-observations\" class=\"network-edge signal\" d=\"M680 187H700\" marker-end=\"url(#network-arrow-a)\"/><path data-edge=\"observation\" data-from=\"concat-observations\" data-to=\"observation-vector\" class=\"network-edge signal\" d=\"M740 187H765\" marker-end=\"url(#network-arrow-a)\"/><g data-node=\"observation-vector\"><rect x=\"765\" y=\"152\" width=\"175\" height=\"70\" rx=\"3\"/><text text-anchor=\"middle\"><tspan class=\"node-title\" x=\"852.5\" y=\"182\">402 / observation</tspan><tspan class=\"node-label\" x=\"852.5\" y=\"204\">3 × 128 + 18</tspan></text></g><path data-edge=\"history\" data-from=\"observation-vector\" data-to=\"history\" class=\"network-edge signal\" d=\"M852 222V285\" marker-end=\"url(#network-arrow-a)\"/><g data-node=\"history\"><rect x=\"765\" y=\"285\" width=\"175\" height=\"78\" rx=\"3\"/><text text-anchor=\"middle\"><tspan class=\"node-title\" x=\"852.5\" y=\"308\">History × 3</tspan><tspan class=\"node-label\" x=\"852.5\" y=\"330\">flatten observations</tspan><tspan class=\"node-label\" x=\"852.5\" y=\"352\">c_obs = 1,206</tspan></text></g><text class=\"edge-label\" x=\"852\" y=\"402\" text-anchor=\"middle\">To conditioning in B</text></svg></div>\n<p class=\"network-note\">The three ResNet34 encoders have separate, trainable ImageNet-initialized weights. Resizing, cropping and normalization precede visual feature extraction.</p>\n<div class=\"network-panel-label\">B · Conditional temporal U-Net</div>\n<div class=\"network-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Conditional temporal U-Net — horizontally scrollable\"><svg class=\"network-svg\" data-network-panel=\"b\" viewBox=\"0 0 960 680\" width=\"960\" height=\"680\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"network-title-b\" aria-describedby=\"network-description-b\"><title id=\"network-title-b\">Conditional temporal U-Net</title><desc id=\"network-description-b\">Noisy 32 by 9 actions pass through three down stages, two bottleneck residual blocks and two up stages. Only two stages downsample and two stages upsample. Skip features from Down 3 and Down 2 concatenate before Up 1 and Up 2. Observation context and a timestep embedding supply FiLM conditioning to all twelve residual blocks, but not the final noise head.</desc><defs><marker id=\"network-arrow-b\" viewBox=\"0 0 8 8\" refX=\"7\" refY=\"4\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0 0L8 4L0 8Z\"/></marker></defs><g data-node=\"noisy-actions\"><rect x=\"60\" y=\"20\" width=\"220\" height=\"62\" rx=\"3\"/><text text-anchor=\"middle\"><tspan class=\"node-title\" x=\"170\" y=\"46\">Noisy actions xₖ</tspan><tspan class=\"node-label\" x=\"170\" y=\"68\">T32 × C9</tspan></text></g><g data-node=\"observation-context\"><rect x=\"310\" y=\"20\" width=\"140\" height=\"62\" rx=\"3\"/><text text-anchor=\"middle\"><tspan class=\"node-title\" x=\"380\" y=\"46\">c_obs</tspan><tspan class=\"node-label\" x=\"380\" y=\"68\">1,206</tspan></text></g><g data-node=\"timestep\"><rect x=\"500\" y=\"20\" width=\"100\" height=\"62\" rx=\"3\"/><text text-anchor=\"middle\"><tspan class=\"node-title\" x=\"550\" y=\"57\">Step k</tspan></text></g><g data-node=\"time-embedding\"><rect x=\"630\" y=\"20\" width=\"240\" height=\"62\" rx=\"3\"/><text text-anchor=\"middle\"><tspan class=\"node-title\" x=\"750\" y=\"46\">Sinusoid + MLP</tspan><tspan class=\"node-label\" x=\"750\" y=\"68\">128 → 512 → 128</tspan></text></g><path data-edge=\"time-embedding\" data-from=\"timestep\" data-to=\"time-embedding\" class=\"network-edge conditioning\" d=\"M600 51H630\" marker-end=\"url(#network-arrow-b)\"/><g data-node=\"condition-concat\"><rect x=\"460\" y=\"100\" width=\"40\" height=\"36\" rx=\"3\"/><text text-anchor=\"middle\"><tspan class=\"node-title\" x=\"480\" y=\"124\">cat</tspan></text></g><path data-edge=\"context-conditioning\" data-from=\"observation-context\" data-to=\"condition-concat\" class=\"network-edge conditioning\" d=\"M380 82V118H460\" marker-end=\"url(#network-arrow-b)\"/><path data-edge=\"time-conditioning\" data-from=\"time-embedding\" data-to=\"condition-concat\" class=\"network-edge conditioning\" d=\"M750 82V95H520V118H500\" marker-end=\"url(#network-arrow-b)\"/><path data-edge=\"condition\" data-from=\"condition-concat\" data-to=\"film\" class=\"network-edge conditioning\" d=\"M480 136V170\" marker-end=\"url(#network-arrow-b)\"/><g data-node=\"film\"><rect x=\"350\" y=\"170\" width=\"260\" height=\"86\" rx=\"3\"/><text text-anchor=\"middle\"><tspan class=\"node-title\" x=\"480\" y=\"197\">c = 1,334</tspan><tspan class=\"node-label\" x=\"480\" y=\"219\">FiLM: learned scale + bias</tspan><tspan class=\"node-label\" x=\"480\" y=\"241\">c reused in 12 ResBlocks</tspan></text></g><path data-edge=\"film-entry\" data-from=\"film\" data-to=\"down1\" class=\"network-edge conditioning\" d=\"M350 213H270\" marker-end=\"url(#network-arrow-b)\"/><g data-node=\"down1\"><rect x=\"80\" y=\"170\" width=\"190\" height=\"86\" rx=\"3\"/><text text-anchor=\"middle\"><tspan class=\"node-title\" x=\"175\" y=\"197\">Down 1</tspan><tspan class=\"node-label\" x=\"175\" y=\"219\">T32 · C256</tspan><tspan class=\"node-label\" x=\"175\" y=\"241\">2× ResBlock · FiLM(c)</tspan></text></g><g data-node=\"down2\"><rect x=\"80\" y=\"350\" width=\"190\" height=\"86\" rx=\"3\"/><text text-anchor=\"middle\"><tspan class=\"node-title\" x=\"175\" y=\"377\">Down 2</tspan><tspan class=\"node-label\" x=\"175\" y=\"399\">T16 · C512</tspan><tspan class=\"node-label\" x=\"175\" y=\"421\">2× ResBlock · FiLM(c)</tspan></text></g><g data-node=\"down3\"><rect x=\"80\" y=\"530\" width=\"190\" height=\"86\" rx=\"3\"/><text text-anchor=\"middle\"><tspan class=\"node-title\" x=\"175\" y=\"557\">Down 3</tspan><tspan class=\"node-label\" x=\"175\" y=\"579\">T8 · C1024</tspan><tspan class=\"node-label\" x=\"175\" y=\"601\">2× ResBlock · FiLM(c)</tspan></text></g><g data-node=\"mid\"><rect x=\"385\" y=\"530\" width=\"190\" height=\"86\" rx=\"3\"/><text text-anchor=\"middle\"><tspan class=\"node-title\" x=\"480\" y=\"557\">Bottleneck</tspan><tspan class=\"node-label\" x=\"480\" y=\"579\">T8 · C1024</tspan><tspan class=\"node-label\" x=\"480\" y=\"601\">2× ResBlock · FiLM(c)</tspan></text></g><g data-node=\"concat8\"><rect x=\"625\" y=\"553\" width=\"50\" height=\"40\" rx=\"3\"/><text text-anchor=\"middle\"><tspan class=\"node-title\" x=\"650\" y=\"579\">cat</tspan></text></g><g data-node=\"up8\"><rect x=\"690\" y=\"530\" width=\"190\" height=\"86\" rx=\"3\"/><text text-anchor=\"middle\"><tspan class=\"node-title\" x=\"785\" y=\"557\">Up 1</tspan><tspan class=\"node-label\" x=\"785\" y=\"579\">T8 · C2048 → 512</tspan><tspan class=\"node-label\" x=\"785\" y=\"601\">2× ResBlock · FiLM(c)</tspan></text></g><g data-node=\"concat16\"><rect x=\"625\" y=\"373\" width=\"50\" height=\"40\" rx=\"3\"/><text text-anchor=\"middle\"><tspan class=\"node-title\" x=\"650\" y=\"399\">cat</tspan></text></g><g data-node=\"up16\"><rect x=\"690\" y=\"350\" width=\"190\" height=\"86\" rx=\"3\"/><text text-anchor=\"middle\"><tspan class=\"node-title\" x=\"785\" y=\"377\">Up 2</tspan><tspan class=\"node-label\" x=\"785\" y=\"399\">T16 · C1024 → 256</tspan><tspan class=\"node-label\" x=\"785\" y=\"421\">2× ResBlock · FiLM(c)</tspan></text></g><g data-node=\"noise-head\"><rect x=\"690\" y=\"170\" width=\"190\" height=\"86\" rx=\"3\"/><text text-anchor=\"middle\"><tspan class=\"node-title\" x=\"785\" y=\"197\">Noise head</tspan><tspan class=\"node-label\" x=\"785\" y=\"219\">T32 · C256 → 9</tspan><tspan class=\"node-label\" x=\"785\" y=\"241\">Conv1D + 1×1 Conv</tspan></text></g><g data-node=\"predicted-noise\"><rect x=\"695\" y=\"112\" width=\"180\" height=\"38\" rx=\"3\"/><text text-anchor=\"middle\"><tspan class=\"node-title\" x=\"785\" y=\"137\">εθ · T32 × C9</tspan></text></g><g data-node=\"downsample1\"><path class=\"sampling\" d=\"M130 285H220L200 323H150Z\"/><text class=\"edge-label\" x=\"175\" y=\"310\" text-anchor=\"middle\">↓ 2</text></g><g data-node=\"downsample2\"><path class=\"sampling\" d=\"M130 465H220L200 503H150Z\"/><text class=\"edge-label\" x=\"175\" y=\"490\" text-anchor=\"middle\">↓ 2</text></g><g data-node=\"upsample1\"><path class=\"sampling\" d=\"M740 465H830L810 503H760Z\"/><text class=\"edge-label\" x=\"785\" y=\"490\" text-anchor=\"middle\">↑ 2</text></g><g data-node=\"upsample2\"><path class=\"sampling\" d=\"M740 285H830L810 323H760Z\"/><text class=\"edge-label\" x=\"785\" y=\"310\" text-anchor=\"middle\">↑ 2</text></g><path data-edge=\"noisy-input\" data-from=\"noisy-actions\" data-to=\"down1\" class=\"network-edge signal\" d=\"M170 82V135H175V170\" marker-end=\"url(#network-arrow-b)\"/><path data-edge=\"down1-stride\" data-from=\"down1\" data-to=\"downsample1\" class=\"network-edge signal\" d=\"M175 256V285\" marker-end=\"url(#network-arrow-b)\"/><path data-edge=\"stride1-down2\" data-from=\"downsample1\" data-to=\"down2\" class=\"network-edge signal\" d=\"M175 323V350\" marker-end=\"url(#network-arrow-b)\"/><path data-edge=\"down2-stride\" data-from=\"down2\" data-to=\"downsample2\" class=\"network-edge signal\" d=\"M175 436V465\" marker-end=\"url(#network-arrow-b)\"/><path data-edge=\"stride2-down3\" data-from=\"downsample2\" data-to=\"down3\" class=\"network-edge signal\" d=\"M175 503V530\" marker-end=\"url(#network-arrow-b)\"/><path data-edge=\"down3-mid\" data-from=\"down3\" data-to=\"mid\" class=\"network-edge signal\" d=\"M270 573H385\" marker-end=\"url(#network-arrow-b)\"/><path data-edge=\"mid-cat8\" data-from=\"mid\" data-to=\"concat8\" class=\"network-edge signal\" d=\"M575 573H625\" marker-end=\"url(#network-arrow-b)\"/><path data-edge=\"cat8-up1\" data-from=\"concat8\" data-to=\"up8\" class=\"network-edge signal\" d=\"M675 573H690\" marker-end=\"url(#network-arrow-b)\"/><path data-edge=\"up1-stride\" data-from=\"up8\" data-to=\"upsample1\" class=\"network-edge signal\" d=\"M785 530V503\" marker-end=\"url(#network-arrow-b)\"/><path data-edge=\"stride1-cat16\" data-from=\"upsample1\" data-to=\"concat16\" class=\"network-edge signal\" d=\"M785 465V450H650V413\" marker-end=\"url(#network-arrow-b)\"/><path data-edge=\"cat16-up2\" data-from=\"concat16\" data-to=\"up16\" class=\"network-edge signal\" d=\"M675 393H690\" marker-end=\"url(#network-arrow-b)\"/><path data-edge=\"up2-stride\" data-from=\"up16\" data-to=\"upsample2\" class=\"network-edge signal\" d=\"M785 350V323\" marker-end=\"url(#network-arrow-b)\"/><path data-edge=\"stride2-head\" data-from=\"upsample2\" data-to=\"noise-head\" class=\"network-edge signal\" d=\"M785 285V256\" marker-end=\"url(#network-arrow-b)\"/><path data-edge=\"noise-output\" data-from=\"noise-head\" data-to=\"predicted-noise\" class=\"network-edge signal\" d=\"M785 170V150\" marker-end=\"url(#network-arrow-b)\"/><path data-edge=\"skip16\" data-from=\"down2\" data-to=\"concat16\" class=\"network-edge skip\" d=\"M270 393H625\" marker-end=\"url(#network-arrow-b)\"/><text class=\"edge-label\" x=\"445\" y=\"379\" text-anchor=\"middle\">skip · T16/C512</text><path data-edge=\"skip8\" data-from=\"down3\" data-to=\"concat8\" class=\"network-edge skip\" d=\"M175 616V655H650V593\" marker-end=\"url(#network-arrow-b)\"/><text class=\"edge-label\" x=\"415\" y=\"642\" text-anchor=\"middle\">skip · T8/C1024</text><text class=\"edge-label\" x=\"320\" y=\"310\" text-anchor=\"middle\">T16/C256</text><text class=\"edge-label\" x=\"320\" y=\"490\" text-anchor=\"middle\">T8/C512</text><text class=\"edge-label\" x=\"890\" y=\"310\" text-anchor=\"middle\">T32/C256</text><text class=\"edge-label\" x=\"890\" y=\"490\" text-anchor=\"middle\">T16/C512</text></svg></div>\n<p class=\"network-note\">Each ResBlock receives the same c through its own learned FiLM transform. Skip taps precede downsampling. Down 3 has no further downsampling. There is no skip from Down 1.</p>\n<div class=\"network-panel-label\">C · DDIM inference and action selection</div>\n<div class=\"network-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"DDIM inference and action selection — horizontally scrollable\"><svg class=\"network-svg\" data-network-panel=\"c\" viewBox=\"0 0 960 315\" width=\"960\" height=\"315\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"network-title-c\" aria-describedby=\"network-description-c\"><title id=\"network-title-c\">DDIM inference and action selection</title><desc id=\"network-description-c\">Start from Gaussian noise and reuse the same U-Net for ten DDIM updates. The scheduler receives both the current sample and predicted noise. Select zero-based indices two through nine from the denoised 32 by 9 sequence.</desc><defs><marker id=\"network-arrow-c\" viewBox=\"0 0 8 8\" refX=\"7\" refY=\"4\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0 0L8 4L0 8Z\"/></marker></defs><g data-node=\"initial-noise\"><rect x=\"20\" y=\"70\" width=\"180\" height=\"90\" rx=\"3\"/><text text-anchor=\"middle\"><tspan class=\"node-title\" x=\"110\" y=\"99\">Current sample xₖ</tspan><tspan class=\"node-label\" x=\"110\" y=\"121\">32 × 9</tspan><tspan class=\"node-label\" x=\"110\" y=\"143\">Gaussian at start</tspan></text></g><g data-node=\"denoiser\"><rect x=\"250\" y=\"70\" width=\"190\" height=\"90\" rx=\"3\"/><text text-anchor=\"middle\"><tspan class=\"node-title\" x=\"345\" y=\"99\">U-Net · panel B</tspan><tspan class=\"node-label\" x=\"345\" y=\"121\">Predict noise εθ</tspan><tspan class=\"node-label\" x=\"345\" y=\"143\">Uses k and c</tspan></text></g><g data-node=\"scheduler\"><rect x=\"500\" y=\"70\" width=\"190\" height=\"90\" rx=\"3\"/><text text-anchor=\"middle\"><tspan class=\"node-title\" x=\"595\" y=\"99\">DDIM scheduler</tspan><tspan class=\"node-label\" x=\"595\" y=\"121\">Current sample + εθ</tspan><tspan class=\"node-label\" x=\"595\" y=\"143\">Next sample x_prev</tspan></text></g><g data-node=\"action-chunk\"><rect x=\"740\" y=\"70\" width=\"200\" height=\"90\" rx=\"3\"/><text text-anchor=\"middle\"><tspan class=\"node-title\" x=\"840\" y=\"99\">Denoised actions</tspan><tspan class=\"node-label\" x=\"840\" y=\"121\">32 × 9</tspan><tspan class=\"node-label\" x=\"840\" y=\"143\">After 10 updates</tspan></text></g><g data-node=\"selected-actions\"><rect x=\"740\" y=\"215\" width=\"200\" height=\"78\" rx=\"3\"/><text text-anchor=\"middle\"><tspan class=\"node-title\" x=\"840\" y=\"238\">Select indices 2:10</tspan><tspan class=\"node-label\" x=\"840\" y=\"260\">8 × 9</tspan><tspan class=\"node-label\" x=\"840\" y=\"282\">Absolute TCP poses</tspan></text></g><path data-edge=\"denoiser-input\" data-from=\"initial-noise\" data-to=\"denoiser\" class=\"network-edge signal\" d=\"M200 115H250\" marker-end=\"url(#network-arrow-c)\"/><path data-edge=\"noise-prediction\" data-from=\"denoiser\" data-to=\"scheduler\" class=\"network-edge signal\" d=\"M440 115H500\" marker-end=\"url(#network-arrow-c)\"/><path data-edge=\"scheduler-sample\" data-from=\"initial-noise\" data-to=\"scheduler\" class=\"network-edge signal\" d=\"M110 70V30H595V70\" marker-end=\"url(#network-arrow-c)\"/><text class=\"edge-label\" x=\"345\" y=\"20\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Current noisy sample</text><path data-edge=\"ddim-return\" data-from=\"scheduler\" data-to=\"initial-noise\" class=\"network-edge signal\" d=\"M595 160V205H110V160\" marker-end=\"url(#network-arrow-c)\"/><text class=\"edge-label\" x=\"350\" y=\"195\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Repeat with the next timestep · 10 DDIM updates</text><path data-edge=\"denoised-chunk\" data-from=\"scheduler\" data-to=\"action-chunk\" class=\"network-edge signal\" d=\"M690 115H740\" marker-end=\"url(#network-arrow-c)\"/><path data-edge=\"select-actions\" data-from=\"action-chunk\" data-to=\"selected-actions\" class=\"network-edge signal\" d=\"M840 160V215\" marker-end=\"url(#network-arrow-c)\"/></svg></div>\n<p class=\"network-note\">With three observations, action selection starts at n_obs_steps − 1 = 2, aligned with the current observation. The slice 2:10 selects eight actions from the 32-step prediction.</p>\n<p class=\"network-note\"><strong>Execution:</strong> Undo action normalization → convert rotation6 to a quaternion → execute absolute TCP targets with the Cartesian controller at nominal 20 Hz.</p>\n<figcaption id=\"architecture-caption\">Architecture of the inspected vision-conditioned Diffusion Policy, not a language-conditioned VLA. Dimensions describe the configuration, not an independently verified competition checkpoint.</figcaption>\n<div class=\"network-equivalent\"><strong>Complete text equivalent</strong><ol>\n<li>Three RGB crops, each 3 × 288 × 288, enter separate trainable ResNet34 encoders. Each produces a 512 × 9 × 9 feature map. Spatial softmax produces 64 coordinate pairs. A linear layer and ReLU produce 128 values per camera.</li>\n<li>The 18-value state contains position 3, rotation6 6, connector 2, rail 5 and port 2. Concatenation gives 402 values per observation. Three observations flatten to c_obs = 1,206.</li>\n<li>The diffusion timestep uses a sinusoidal embedding and a 128 → 512 → 128 MLP. Concatenation with c_obs gives c = 1,334. FiLM supplies learned scale and bias to all 12 conditional residual blocks.</li>\n<li>The noisy action sequence is T32 × C9. Down 1 produces T32/C256, then downsamples to T16. Down 2 produces T16/C512, then downsamples to T8. Down 3 produces T8/C1024 without another downsample. Two bottleneck residual blocks preserve T8/C1024.</li>\n<li>Concatenate the T8/C1024 bottleneck and Down 3 skip to get T8/C2048. Up 1 produces T8/C512, then upsamples to T16. Concatenate with the T16/C512 Down 2 skip to get T16/C1024. Up 2 produces T16/C256, then upsamples to T32. A convolutional head predicts T32 × C9 noise. The final head has no FiLM input.</li>\n<li>Inference starts from newly sampled Gaussian noise. The DDIM scheduler uses the current actions and predicted noise across ten updates of the same U-Net. The resulting action sequence contains 32 × 9 values. The start index is n_obs_steps − 1 = 2, aligned with the current observation. Zero-based indices 2:10 select eight poses. Each pose has three position values and six rotation values. Postprocessing restores action units and converts rotation6 to a quaternion before nominal 20 Hz Cartesian execution.</li>\n</ol></div>\n<p class=\"network-training\"><strong>Training only:</strong> Sample from 100 DDPM noise timesteps and minimize mean-squared noise-prediction error. This loss is not an inference stage.</p>\n</figure>","skipConnections":[["down3","concat8"],["down2","concat16"]],"downsampleStages":2,"upsampleStages":2,"context":1206,"conditioning":1334,"actionShape":[32,9],"selectedIndices":[2,3,4,5,6,7,8,9]}
